   "print_setup": "PETG, front end down (chamfered bore and board-slot mouths), 5 mm brim, 0.2 mm layers, 3 walls, 25 % gyroid, no supports. The motor wall bridges the carrier bore, so the motor seat is a top surface; the M1.6 countersinks (45° cones) and the board rest are on the bridge's underside. The end of the motor-side wall stands 1.6 mm above the rear face, and the bevel of its notch prints as a 45° overhang (0.12 mm layers for the last 2 mm make it 5 layers instead of 3). The five 1.7 mm insert holes run straight into the end faces."
  },
